msgid "Qwen3.5-9B — fastest and most accurate in testing (recommended)"
msgstr "Qwen3.5-9B —— 实测最快最准(推荐)"

#: ilang-readable-slugs.php:34
msgid "DeepSeek-V4-Flash — alternative"
msgstr "DeepSeek-V4-Flash —— 备选"

#: ilang-readable-slugs.php:35
msgid "Qwen3.5-27B — larger, slower"
msgstr "Qwen3.5-27B —— 更大,更慢"

#: ilang-readable-slugs.php:77
msgid "Support"
msgstr "支持"

#: ilang-readable-slugs.php:82
msgid "Report an issue or suggest a feature"
msgstr "反馈问题或提建议"

#: ilang-readable-slugs.php:116
msgid "Settings"
msgstr "设置"

#: ilang-readable-slugs.php:117
msgid "Set up"
msgstr "开始设置"

#. translators: %s: error message from the HTTP layer
#: ilang-readable-slugs.php:247
#, php-format
msgid "Request failed: %s"
msgstr "请求失败:%s"

#. translators: %s: error message returned by the AI provider
#: ilang-readable-slugs.php:254
#, php-format
msgid "The provider returned an error: %s"
msgstr "服务商返回错误:%s"

#: ilang-readable-slugs.php:260
msgid "The provider returned no content."
msgstr "服务商没有返回内容。"

#. translators: %s: the truncated model output
#: ilang-readable-slugs.php:264
#, php-format
msgid "Output was cut off by max_tokens: %s"
msgstr "输出被 max_tokens 截断:%s"

#. translators: %s: the unusable text the model returned
#: ilang-readable-slugs.php:277
#, php-format
msgid "The model returned something unusable as a slug: %s"
msgstr "模型返回的内容无法用作 slug:%s"

#: ilang-readable-slugs.php:287
msgid "Readable Slugs"
msgstr "智能链接"

#: ilang-readable-slugs.php:296
#: ilang-readable-slugs.php:343
#: ilang-readable-slugs.php:373
msgid "Insufficient permissions."
msgstr "权限不足。"

#: ilang-readable-slugs.php:406
msgid "Settings saved."
msgstr "设置已保存。"

#. translators: 1: sample post title, 2: generated slug
#: ilang-readable-slugs.php:414
#, php-format
msgid "Connection works. Sample title %1$s became %2$s"
msgstr "连接正常。示例标题 %1$s 生成为 %2$s"

#: ilang-readable-slugs.php:426
msgid "The last attempt failed, so generation is paused for up to 10 minutes. Saving settings resumes it immediately."
msgstr "上次生成失败,已暂停最多 10 分钟。保存设置可立即恢复。"

#: ilang-readable-slugs.php:432
msgid "One step to get started"
msgstr "只差一步就能用"

#. translators: %s: link to sign up with the default provider
#: ilang-readable-slugs.php:437
#, php-format
msgid "Paste an API key below and save. Any OpenAI-compatible provider works — if you do not have one yet, %s. The free credit alone covers a long time of normal use (well under a cent per slug)."
msgstr "在下面填入 API 密钥并保存即可。任何 OpenAI 兼容服务商都行 —— 还没有的话,%s。光是赠送额度就够正常用很久(每个链接不到一分钱)。"

#: ilang-readable-slugs.php:438
msgid "sign up at SiliconFlow"
msgstr "到硅基流动注册一个"

#: ilang-readable-slugs.php:442
msgid "That link is the author's referral link: signing up through it gives bonus credit to both you and this project. A key from anywhere else works exactly the same."
msgstr "那是作者的邀请链接:通过它注册,你和本项目都会拿到赠送额度。用别处的密钥效果完全一样。"

#: ilang-readable-slugs.php:446
msgid "Post titles that are not written in English get a readable English slug when you save them. Titles already in English, slugs you typed yourself, and already-published posts are never touched. If generation fails, WordPress just does what it normally would — publishing is never blocked."
msgstr "保存文章时,非英文标题会自动获得一个好读的英文链接。已经是英文的标题、你手工填过的链接、以及已发布的旧文,都不会被改动。生成失败时 WordPress 按原本的方式处理 —— 发布永远不会被卡住。"

#: ilang-readable-slugs.php:455
msgid "API key"
msgstr "API 密钥"

#: ilang-readable-slugs.php:458
msgid "Saved — leave blank to keep"
msgstr "已保存 —— 留空则不修改"

#: ilang-readable-slugs.php:460
msgid "Leave blank to keep the key you already saved."
msgstr "留空表示保留已保存的密钥。"

#: ilang-readable-slugs.php:465
msgid "Model"
msgstr "模型"

#: ilang-readable-slugs.php:473
msgid "Custom model ID…"
msgstr "自定义模型 ID…"

#: ilang-readable-slugs.php:478
msgid "The default is a good choice for this job. Pick \"Custom model ID\" only if you know which model you want."
msgstr "默认这个就很适合干这活。除非你确知要用哪个模型,否则不用选\"自定义\"。"

#: ilang-readable-slugs.php:482
msgid "Site context"
msgstr "站点背景"

#: ilang-readable-slugs.php:483
msgid "(optional)"
msgstr "(可选)"

#: ilang-readable-slugs.php:486
msgid "e.g. Camera review blog; brands that come up often: canon, sony, dji"
msgstr "例:相机评测博客;常出现的品牌:canon、sony、dji"

#: ilang-readable-slugs.php:487
msgid "Naming your topic and the brands you write about noticeably improves how proper nouns are spelled in slugs."
msgstr "写明你的主题和常写的品牌,能明显改善链接里专有名词的拼写。"

#: ilang-readable-slugs.php:491
msgid "Generation"
msgstr "自动生成"

#: ilang-readable-slugs.php:495
msgid "Generate slugs automatically when a post is saved"
msgstr "保存文章时自动生成链接"

#: ilang-readable-slugs.php:500
msgid "Advanced"
msgstr "高级"

#: ilang-readable-slugs.php:503
msgid "Use a different provider"
msgstr "换一个服务商"

#: ilang-readable-slugs.php:505
msgid "API base URL"
msgstr "API 地址"

#: ilang-readable-slugs.php:508
msgid "Any OpenAI-compatible endpoint. HTTPS only. Leave this alone unless you are switching providers."
msgstr "任何 OpenAI 兼容接口,仅限 HTTPS。不换服务商就别动它。"

#: ilang-readable-slugs.php:514
msgid "Save settings"
msgstr "保存设置"

#: ilang-readable-slugs.php:521
msgid "Test connection"
msgstr "测试连接"

#: ilang-readable-slugs.php:523
msgid "Save an API key first."
msgstr "请先保存 API 密钥。"

#: ilang-readable-slugs.php:530
msgid "Last failure:"
msgstr "最近一次失败:"

#: ilang-readable-slugs.php:534
msgid "Keeps happening? Tell us — the report is pre-filled with your versions."
msgstr "一直这样?告诉我们 —— 报告已自动带上你的版本信息。"

#. translators: 1: link to the support forum, 2: link to open a GitHub issue
#: ilang-readable-slugs.php:544
#, php-format
msgid "Something not working, or an idea for it? Ask on the %1$s, or %2$s — both are read by the author."
msgstr "哪里不好用,或者有什么想法?到%1$s提问,或者%2$s —— 作者两边都看。"

#: ilang-readable-slugs.php:545
msgid "support forum"
msgstr "支持论坛"

#: ilang-readable-slugs.php:546
msgid "open an issue on GitHub"
msgstr "去 GitHub 提 issue"
